msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫None as sharp as you, Mell.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Put yourself in my shoes, and you’ll "
"understand.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I want to give you any advantage you can get."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Nessuno che ha il tuo stesso ingegno, Mell.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Mettiti nei miei panni, e "
"capirai.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Voglio darti ogni vantaggio possibile."

