#: scenario:scenario_71649F88_1301_47C2_A44F_B5AAF32CF195
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd68b2884058d89e6e4f526df3256b211c57d82f7d30bdea707a7afbd21a14d5
