#: scenario:scenario_11C95470_0319_414A_8794_19FFC3D77710
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee2da0aa43e9e11407a3579a1b2bc257dde609897f927e70f460d30d6cd99e34
