msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That’s the spirit.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫If you need anything, don’t hesitate to ask.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"I’m proud to have you as my pupil."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Questo è lo spirito giusto.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Se ti serve qualcosa, non esitare a "
