msgid "⟪k:0⟫He was so skilled even the royal family had commissioned work from him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Era così abile che persino la famiglia reale gli aveva commissionato⟪k:1⟫dei lavori."

#: scenario:scenario_709D326D_9458_4BAF_B8F2_C5AA5B231306
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d709043dc75a0d977048a9f6de00dbf5cc1a8e582fa3585a0a8786f62dfbdea6
