"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Such a kind lad, Young Master.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫M’ boy back home could do well t’ learn a "
"thing or two from ya."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫È⟪k:4⟫ proprio un ragazzo gentile, Padron Rhodes.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Mio figlio a casa "
"farebbe bene ad imparare qualcosa da uno come lei."

#: scenario:scenario_7E2670E0_A149_4880_8D47_972EED2502FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb89e49ea0dc12d41d8ad4221d9dd467320820e81f1e70a4bba754f6cbfc123d
