#: scenario:scenario_8F2BF860_50C4_4AEF_8EC8_B9505BA171E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8359e37df0e1dd4c0faf690f32bcb9632439333846b878403174952cb90b605c
#. default-sha256: 447fe502fcff5a499add8330fca89891cc438a96344a34c274527ea4e869b933
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8F2BF860_50C4_4AEF_8EC8_B9505BA171E5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As he drew closer to the mansion, the rich fragrance of roses grew more prominent. ⟪k:1⟫Over "
"time, this distinctive scent had led visitors to refer to the house as “Rose Manor.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Avvicinandosi sempre di più alla villa, la ricca fragranza delle rose⟪k:1⟫si faceva man mano "
"più forte. ⟪k:2⟫Col tempo, questo caratteristico profumo aveva portato i visitatori a riferirsi "
"alla casa col nome di “Rose Manor”, ossia “la Villa delle Rose”."

#: scenario:scenario_30E272F1_7AE7_4E5E_B4D4_730C419387AC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dca853667befe8de9d7455c3e2da1c5af847a4e733746ee4cfbe3352d6bd624d
#. default-sha256: a4bd9555f53197a19f462de11cdda6e20c22b5d4995befa0e0e748f6e22375c8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_30E272F1_7AE7_4E5E_B4D4_730C419387AC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was also probably a play on the flaxen-haired family’s last name, “Rhodes,” which you "
"heard the owner of the jewelry store say just moments earlier."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era probabilmente un gioco di parole sul cognome della famiglia dai capelli dorati, "
"“Rhodes”, come lei ha potuto sentire dal proprietario della gioielleria giusto pochi istanti fa."

#: scenario:scenario_F5502D53_9AB9_4E94_BF88_788382F62A14
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0515d2cb106ae2af22576e0f75132a173d81f7f577d4c57931c199b9882ad988
#. default-sha256: fb43b401498a0a8c1afb0d6752975f94b3634558c487b7ef71d09bfb395f6f43
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F5502D53_9AB9_4E94_BF88_788382F62A14"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The mansion looked quite different than it does now, no?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫No thickets of ivy "
"covering the walls, and no rotten, broken doors to be found."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La villa sembrava molto diversa da com’è adesso, no?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Niente rami d’edera a coprire "
"le pareti, e senza porte marce e distrutte."

#: scenario:scenario_CEEC7699_92E6_486D_B1EA_7486BE60CB97
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4672e72446bf264a47b0992550ae1e371a3419923740fe4623fa6666a6006174
#. default-sha256: 45bb3c130cb25c15c35eddbfef94007ebee09aeb6f30b247a41e92cea6deaf77
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CEEC7699_92E6_486D_B1EA_7486BE60CB97"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wonder what the Rhodes family would think if they saw the house in its present, tragic "
"condition."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mi chiedo che cosa penserebbe la famiglia Rhodes se vedesse la casa⟪k:1⟫nella sua attuale, "
"tragica condizione."

#: scenario:scenario_66746C73_6527_48ED_9DB9_BA3C2A8CCF36
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 073ce497d57ec5f032492ad93bf73aed99d112a1587145e84798307994fa16e0
#. default-sha256: 18aa5b191deb52b1c767fd781d9e727310948a4ee3ae2d1516e22a92a664f310
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_66746C73_6527_48ED_9DB9_BA3C2A8CCF36"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sight of their abundantly blooming roses—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a veritable symbol of prosperity—⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫long since withered and turned into soil."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La vista delle loro rose abbondantemente fiorite—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫un vero e proprio simbolo di "
"prosperità—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ormai appassite e trasformate in terra."

#: scenario:scenario_59C35A13_5718_45F5_A799_DCB0C19302C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d2956a9a0571476acfb1261d6957cd544892d49123736ebc65b4e818e38aa33
